# Keep the build context small & reproducible: never ship local installs,
# build outputs, secrets, or VCS/tooling state into the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.nx
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.vercel
**/.turbo
.git
.github
**/*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.DS_Store
apps/api/.uploads
